{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:16 2026-08-30 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c170c7ac1b7237e881a2e1d7af548ed6/2026-08/178790134632460.png\"/>\n<p>《英國太陽報》（The Sunday Times）最新發佈的Parent Power 2026英國私立學校排行榜，以最新 GCSE 及 A-Level 成績綜合評定，選出全英國表現最頂尖的10間私校。</p>\n<p>其中8間位於大倫敦地區，展現倫敦私校在教育水平上的絕對優勢。另外，單性別學校表現更為突出，5間女校榜上有名。即睇名單：</p>\n<table>\n<row span=\"5\">\n<cell>2026排名</cell>\n<cell>學校名稱</cell>\n<cell>學校類別</cell>\n<cell>所在地區</cell>\n<cell>2026年度學費參考</cell>\n</row>\n<row span=\"5\"><cell>1</cell><cell>St Paul’s School</cell><cell>男校/ 日校及寄宿</cell><cell>倫敦西南部Barnes</cell><cell> <p>寄宿生每年£53,943</p><p>（折合約港幣$575,000）</p></cell> </row>\n<row span=\"5\"><cell>2</cell><cell>Brighton College</cell><cell>男女校 / 日校及寄宿</cell><cell>東薩塞克斯郡Brighton</cell><cell> <p>中六寄宿每年£66,375</p><p>（折合約港幣$708,000）</p></cell> </row>\n<row span=\"5\"><cell>3</cell><cell>North London Collegiate School</cell><cell>女校 / 日校</cell><cell>倫敦北部Edgware</cell><cell> <p>日校生每年£29,751</p><p>（折合約港幣$317,000）</p></cell> </row>\n<row span=\"5\"><cell>4</cell><cell>Godolphin and Latymer School</cell><cell>女校 / 日校</cell><cell>倫敦西部Hammersmith</cell><cell> <p>日校生每年£34,622</p><p>（折合約港幣$369,000）</p></cell> </row>\n<row span=\"5\"><cell>5</cell><cell>Guildford High School</cell><cell>女校 / 日校</cell><cell>薩里郡Guildford</cell><cell> <p>日校生每年£25,989</p></cell> </row>\n<row span=\"5\"><cell>6</cell><cell>St Paul’s Girls’ School</cell><cell>女校 / 日校</cell><cell>倫敦西部Hammersmith</cell><cell> <p>日校生每年£40,227</p><p>（折合約港幣$429,000）</p></cell> </row>\n<row span=\"5\"><cell>7</cell><cell>King’s College School, Wimbledon</cell><cell>男校（中六招收女生）/ 日校</cell><cell>倫敦西南部Wimbledon</cell><cell> <p>9年級以上日校生每年£34,212</p><p>（折合約港幣$365,000）</p></cell> </row>\n<row span=\"5\"><cell>8</cell><cell>Westminster School</cell><cell>男校（中六招收女生）/ 日校及寄宿</cell><cell>倫敦市中心Westminster</cell><cell> <p>寄宿/日校混合每年高達 £65,976</p><p>（折合約港幣$703,000）</p></cell> </row>\n<row span=\"5\"><cell>9</cell><cell>City of London School for Girls</cell><cell>女校 / 日校</cell><cell>倫敦市中心Barbican</cell><cell> <p>日校生每年£30,247</p><p>（折合約港幣$322,000）</p></cell> </row>\n<row><cell>10</cell><cell>Latymer Upper School</cell><cell>男女校 / 日校</cell><cell>倫敦西部Hammersmith</cell><cell> <p>日校生每年£31,095</p><p>（折合約港幣$331,000）</p></cell> </row>\n</table>\n<img alt=\"St Paul's School奪得 2026全英最佳私立中學（學術卓越獎）頭銜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fa8279cf3458e7e5f5b6fdb2535f593/2026-08/0564_St_Pauls_School_Science_Building_15.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Brighton College排名第2，同時也是全英國排名最高的男女校。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/981a7dd47f66b1e6b4b48300226df02d/2026-08/65116381046d708ff3482750_brighton-college.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"North London Collegiate School在Sixth Form階段提供A-Level 與 IB（國際文憑）雙軌制課程，打破傳統頂尖女校只提供單一課程的局限。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/faa1fb50f11abd4da942cb9d06d0e1d1/2026-08/0b79a9170074.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Godolphin and Latymer School同樣提供 A-Level 與 IB（國際文憑）雙軌制課程，92%的學生成功入讀其第一志願大學。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a1f1d9908bcdab9e210a21e202b14d96/2026-08/Godolphin-Latymer-School-Building.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Guildford High School 專注於A-Level 課程，其公開試成績長年位居全英前三甲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e1aa9b9aa0243484da3da1d1594be276/2026-08/666825c72377dbf54a240816_girls-high-school-guildford05.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"King's College School, Wimbledon每年均有25% - 30%的畢業生獲牛津大學與劍橋大學錄取。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c812e1b64ab107c9cf75739652856a5/2026-08/kings-college-new-landscaping.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Westminster School採取傳統的英國公學體制，中學部（Year 9-11）為純男校，高中部（Year 12-13 Sixth Form）則轉為男女混校。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1076858131aa5184db3ce29850a49a82/2026-08/westminster-in-profile.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"City of London School for Girls善用其金融城中心的地理優勢，為女生提供大量直通金融機構、跨國企業與頂尖文化藝術單位的實習與交流機會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/631aff5b995963c5c8821bf19e1265df/2026-08/CLSG-2022-05-10-0958-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Latymer Upper School被《The Sunday Times》評為「全英國表現第一的私立男女日校」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e622be99a23512cff79ebe5fa700b89/2026-08/Latymer_Upper_School_1895_Building.jpg\"/>\n<p>來源：Best secondary schools 2026</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T07:38:43.255291+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1053,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}